{
  "slug": "monocle",
  "name": "Monocle",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Review your AI agent's code as it writes it. Leave comments on diffs, submit structured feedback, and watch the agent fix things in real time — all from your terminal",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **4 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `get-feedback` (Retrieves pending review feedback from Monocle), `get-feedback-wait` (Blocks until the reviewer submits feedback through Monocle, then acts on it), `review-plan` (Sends a plan file to Monocle for the reviewer to see), `review-plan-wait` (Sends a plan file to Monocle and blocks until the reviewer responds with feedback)\n- **Commands** (4): `get-feedback-wait` (Block until reviewer submits feedback), `get-feedback` (Retrieve review feedback from Monocle), `review-plan-wait` (Send a plan and wait for review feedback), `review-plan` (Send a plan to Monocle for review)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `monocle`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install monocle@claude-community` from `josephschmitt/monocle`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "command": 4,
    "mcp": 1
  },
